<title>JAPAN: Beltecno - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Beltecno - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.68		vs	    9.19</p>
<p> Operating	  269    million    vs	  208    million</p>
<p> Current	    295    million    vs	  411    million</p>
<p> Net		  184    million    vs	  205    million</p>
<p> EPS		   23.86 yen	  vs	   26.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Beltecno Corp is a manufacturer of construction and housing equipment.</p>
</text>
